<title>UK: Lehman Brothers adds $100 million to four-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers adds $100 million to four-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Sanwa International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDINGS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LEHMAN BROS HOLDINGS INC</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     0.375     PAY DATE   *21.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.80     FULL FEES   0.325</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.80</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS 15 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
